      "canonical_name": "Monument to the Victims of the USS Maine",
      "native_name": "Monumento a las víctimas del Maine",
      "language": "es",
      "country": "Cuba",
      "notes": "Havana Maine Monument designed by Felix Cabarrocas, erected 1924-25, damaged by the 1926 hurricane and rebuilt in 1927. The Cuban Friendship Urn uses physical material from the damaged monument and derives relief/design elements from it."
