      "language": "es",
      "country": "Uruguay",
      "notes": "Monument inaugurated in Plaza Independencia, San José de Mayo, in 1898. Uruguay's 2004 heritage resolution identifies Washington, DC among foreign bronzes copying the San José monument."
    },
